    Bhinnashtakavarga (BAV, 0-8 bindus per sign) for each of the 7 classical planets, plus the
    combined Samudaya Ashtakavarga (SAV, always totaling 337 bindus across all 12 signs).
    Signs occupied in the natal D1 chart are highlighted. Only the Parasara method is built -
    a "Varahamihira method" is not implemented pending a confirmed source.
  </p>
  <div class="ashtakavarga-tiles">
    {% for tile in ashtakavarga_tiles %}
    <div class="ashtakavarga-tile {% if tile.pending %}held{% endif %}">
      <h3 class="mini-chart-title">{% if tile.pending %}&#128274; {% endif %}{{ tile.label }}</h3>
      {% if tile.pending %}
      <div class="held-chart-notice">
        <p class="held-chart-title">&#128274; Not shown on purpose - this isn't a bug</p>
        <p class="hint pending-note">No verified classical scoring table exists yet for the
           Ascendant's own Ashtakavarga chart, so nothing is guessed here.</p>
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <div class="mini-chart-grid">
        {% for row in tile.grid %}
          {% for cell in row %}
            {% if cell is none %}
            <div class="mini-chart-cell blank"></div>
            {% else %}
            <div class="mini-chart-cell bindus-{{ cell.bindus }} {% if cell.is_natal_occupied %}natal-occupied{% endif %}">
              <span class="cell-sign">{{ cell.sign.value[:3] }}</span>
              <span class="cell-bindus">{{ cell.bindus }}</span>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

